# SHA-256 hashes for embedded binary resources.
# Format: <uppercase SHA-256 hex>  <path relative to repo root>
#
# To generate a hash:
#   certutil -hashfile avast_av_clear.exe SHA256
#
# Uncomment and update the line below with the real hash of your avast_av_clear.exe:
# AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA  avast_av_clear.exe
